        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1-2. The Board has determined that the provisions of Section 19 of Article 1 of the New Jersey Constitution can best be effectuated by entering into this Agreement with the Association, and the Board hereby recognizes the Association for purposes of professional negotiation as the exclusive representative of those employees of the Public Schools of Jersey City, certified by the State Department of Education, in the following unit including those with tenure, probationary status and on contract, implied or stated, excepting those on per diem assignment.",
